<main class="main">
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="grid--two-col">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h1>Upcoming Events, Tours and Gigs</h1>
            <p>Lorem ipsum, dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dignissimos consectetur rem cupiditate quae totam voluptatem odit eaque eveniet ex vitae odio consequatur, obcaecati eos sit, asperiores ducimus alias. Sint, eveniet!</p>
            <p>Check out our <a href="./past-events/">past events</a> to see how prolific we are!</p>
